cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Forma, please cite the companion paper and, where relevant, the archival forecast deposit."
title: "Forma: A Tuple-Set Transformer Pro-Forma Financial Statement Forecaster"
abstract: >-
  Forma is a tuple-set Transformer that jointly forecasts the complete quarterly
  financial statements of U.S. public firms at horizons of 1 to 20 quarters,
  emitting a predictive distribution per statement item. This repository ships
  the model code, the configurations for Forma and every competitor in the
  ProForma-20Q benchmark, and the trained Forma checkpoints -- five seeds each
  for the Gaussian and Laplace families -- so a reader goes from checkpoint to
  forecast to the paper's published numbers. It ships no data; real-data
  reproduction uses the companion ProForma-20Q package and WRDS credentials.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/forma-lab-mccombs/forma-release"
url: "https://github.com/forma-lab-mccombs/forma-release"
keywords:
